  └── b2b_auction/*            ← models, schemas, services
Background Jobs
- Support Escalation: Background loop (asyncio.create_task) in main.py:139 runs start_support_escalation_loop() from core/support_escalation.py
- Email Tasks: BackgroundTasks used in cart.py:639 for SendOrderConfirmation
- Referral Settlement: core/order_status_logic.py:settle_referral_commissions_for_order() called synchronously during status updates
External Integrations
- Email: SMTP Gmail (fastapi-mail) - for OTPs, order confirmations, dealer status
- Payment: Mock gateway (no real integration) + Razorpay mock endpoints
- SMS: Mock implementation (logger only)
- Encryption: AesEngine + Fernet for PII fields (PAN, Aadhaar, bank details)
Authentication Architecture
- Customers: OTP-based (no password). Separate customer_users table. JWT payload: { sub, is_customer: true, exp }
- Staff (Admin/Dealer/Rider/Hub/Showroom/Logistics/Helpdesk): Email/Password with Argon2 hashing. Uses users table. JWT payload: { sub, role, is_customer: false, exp }
- JWT Algorithm: HS256, expiry: 11520 min (8 days)
Authorization System
- core/permissions.py defines:
- get_current_user() → JWT decode → look up in users or customer_users
- require_role(roles: list[UserRole]) → generic role check
- require_admin() → ADMIN or SUPER_ADMIN
- require_super_admin() → SUPER_ADMIN only
- require_dealer() → any dealer role
- require_dealer_manager() → DEALER or DEALER_MANAGER
- require_inventory_access() → DEALER, DEALER_MANAGER, DEALER_INVENTORY
- require_order_access() → DEALER, DEALER_MANAGER, DEALER_ORDERS
- require_hub() → any hub role
- require_logistics() → LOGISTICS_ADMIN, LOGISTICS_MANAGER
- require_logistics_or_admin() → logistics + admin
- require_dealer_or_admin() → dealer roles + admin
